@@ -6,36 +6,62 @@
  * and an encoded string format that requires zero schema changes.
  *
  * Key Hierarchy:
- * - Master Key (SECRETS_MASTER_KEY env var) wraps ->
+ * - Master Key (SECRETS_MASTER_KEY env var, optional SECRETS_MASTER_KEY_PREVIOUS
